&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;82h45&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;2env-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;2env-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;2env-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If you read this far and think: &quot;that&#39;s me!&quot; — You probably won&#39;t need to read any further, and we should have a conversation. But if you doubt the experience we expect you to have, the following should help clarify.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;82h45&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;2k45u-0-0&quot;&gt;
