&lt;li&gt;Partnering with engineering leads to prioritizing technical investments and establishing realistic delivery timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with downstream Elastic solution teams (Observability, Security, Enterprise Search) to understand their specific onboarding flows and trial experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive technical decision-making regarding onboarding, activation, expansion and retention of self-service customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with customers and trial users to gather feedback on trial experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales &amp;amp; Marketing on competitive positioning and brand awareness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive native integrations with 3rd party developers platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
