&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;ct6k5-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;ct6k5-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We are requiring Support Engineers hired under this listing to work four ten-hour US overnight shifts either Sunday-Wednesday or Wednesday-Saturday. For training purposes, the selected candidate will work during the day US-East for three to six months before changing to overnight shifts. Candidates will be expected to work this shift for 18 months prior to consideration for other positions. Candidates will be required to undergo US Government background checks if selected, potentially including vetting for Public Trust.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
